      "name": "[Blueprint][Cissia] Ouroboros Loop - Lv. 50",
      "desc": "This blueprint can be used to unlock the crafting of Cissia's exclusive Tactical Prism at the Smart Workshop. Obtained through investigations or purchased from Boojee's Store - Permanent Store - Blueprint Direct Sale.\nItem Effect: When using Etheric Phantom to enter Stealth, Stealth duration is extended by 3s.\nAfter using <color=#FFFFFF>EX Special Attack</color>, gains the <color=#FFFFFF>Viper Strike</color> effect: When any Non-<color=#FFFFFF>Corrode Bone</color> attack hits an enemy, it <color=#2BAD00>triggers a free special <color=#FFFFFF>Corrode Bone</color></color> that cannot inflict Daze. This effect can be triggered once every 1s and lasts for 6s.",
